     "type": "tip",
     "tag": "Spanish speaker alert",
     "title": "\"Adelante\" is ahead, not forward",
     "paras": [
      "For the engine, <i>adelante</i> is <b>ahead</b>: <i>Slow ahead.</i>",
      "<b>Forward</b> is a place on board, the bow: <i>forward station</i>, <i>the forward spring</i>.",
      "And <i>atrás</i> is <b>astern</b>, not <i>back</i> or <i>aft</i>."
     ],
     "avoid": "Slow forward. · Half back. · Full aft."
